ng an intrabar path. This does not replace multi-candle body-edge rules. Reproducible bearish correction segmentation and its unresolved boundary cases, including doji/Close == Open, gaps, a bullish candle that simultaneously produces a new low, exact LL-candle inclusivity, ambiguous start-boundary precedence, and exact turn membership, remain unresolved. A reproducible visual bootstrap, equal-coordinate candle identity, and other structural coordinates remain unresolved.", NasdaqSource),
